      "description": "Signature coupon: body with names and serial, perforated stub with the amount; the stub tears off when a payment is confirmed (previewed on hover/focus).",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-coupon\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"ds-coupon-body\"><span class=\"ds-coupon-label\">คุณ → มิ้นต์</span><span class=\"ds-serial\">No. 2116-61</span></div><div class=\"ds-coupon-stub\">1,800<small>฿</small></div></div>",
      "css": ":host,:root{--color-ink:#14302b;--color-ink-2:#1f443d;--color-ground:#eef1ef;--color-paper:#fff;--color-muted:#4f625d;--color-line:#d3dcd8;--color-perf:#a9b8b2;--color-serial:#a3271f;--color-owe:#a3271f;--color-wait:#8a5300;--color-wait-soft:#fbefd6;--color-ok:#1d6b4a;--color-pp:#1b3f73;--color-t0:#f6cdd6;--color-t1:#c4e8d6;--radius-coupon:10px;--ease-out-expo:cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)} .ds-coupon{font-family:Anuphan,system-ui,sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:stretch;overflow:hidden;border-radius:var(--radius-coupon);background:var(--color-t0);color:var(--color-ink);max-width:340px}.ds-coupon-body{flex:1;padding:12px 14px}.ds-coupon-label{display:block;font-size:16px;font-weight:600}.ds-serial{display:block;margin-top:4px;font-family:Kanit,Anuphan,system-ui,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--color-serial)}.ds-coupon-stub{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end;min-width:88px;padding:0 14px;border-left:2px dashed rgb(20 48 43 / .3);font-family:Kanit,Anuphan,system-ui,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:22px;font-weight:600;transform-origin:left top;transition:transform 280ms var(--ease-out-expo),opacity 280ms var(--ease-out-expo)}.ds-coupon-stub small{margin-left:4px;font-size:.72em;font-weight:500}.ds-coupon:hover .ds-coupon-stub,.ds-coupon:focus-visible .ds-coupon-stub{transform:translate(24px,10px) rotate(6deg);opacity:0}.ds-coupon:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-ink);outline-offset:2px}@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-coupon-stub{transform:none!important;transition:opacity 200ms linear}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Trip Header and Tab Bar",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "header-band",
      "description": "Ink header band with trip name and live chip; paper three-tab bar with an ink bar on the active tab.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-nav\"><header class=\"ds-band\"><div><div class=\"ds-band-title\">เชียงดาว ปีใหม่</div><div class=\"ds-band-meta\">2 คน</div></div><span class=\"ds-live\"><i></i>สด</span></header><nav class=\"ds-tabs\"><button>รายจ่าย</button><button aria-current=\"page\">สรุปยอด</button><button>สมาชิก</button></nav></div>",
      "css": ":host,:root{--color-ink:#14302b;--color-ink-2:#1f443d;--color-ground:#eef1ef;--color-paper:#fff;--color-muted:#4f625d;--color-line:#d3dcd8;--color-perf:#a9b8b2;--color-serial:#a3271f;--color-owe:#a3271f;--color-wait:#8a5300;--color-wait-soft:#fbefd6;--color-ok:#1d6b4a;--color-pp:#1b3f73;--color-t0:#f6cdd6;--color-t1:#c4e8d6;--radius-coupon:10px;--ease-out-expo:cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)} .ds-nav{font-family:Anuphan,system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:360px;background:var(--color-ground)}.ds-band{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px 16px;background:var(--color-ink);color:#fff}.ds-band-title{font-size:22px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25}.ds-band-meta{font-size:14px;color:#b9d0c9}.ds-live{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:var(--color-t1);color:var(--color-ink);font-size:14px;font-weight:600}.ds-live i{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--color-ok)}.ds-tabs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);margin-top:48px;border-top:1px solid var(--color-line);background:var(--color-paper)}.ds-tabs button{font-family:Anuphan,system-ui,sans-serif;position:relative;min-height:64px;border:0;background:none;color:var(--color-muted);font-size:14px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}.ds-tabs button:hover,.ds-tabs button[aria-current]{color:var(--color-ink)}.ds-tabs button[aria-current]::before{content:'';position:absolute;left:24px;right:24px;top:0;height:3px;border-radius:0 0 4px 4px;background:var(--color-ink)}.ds-tabs button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-ink);outline-offset:2px}"
